      "content": "the \"moving forward\" thing is what's so hard. how do you move forward when you feel like your very presence just makes things worse? like, i look at the people i hurt and i just feel this intense need for them to never have to deal with me again. it feels like the only way for the world to actually be better off is if i wasn't even a part of it. does that even make sense? like, isn't there a point where some things are just too heavy to carry?",
